menu "MT6701 Driver Configuration"

    config MT6701_THREAD_SAFE
        bool "Protect each MT6701 instance with a mutex"
        default y
        help
            When enabled, each mt6701_dev_t contains a statically allocated
            FreeRTOS mutex. The driver uses it to serialize I2C transactions and
            access to calibration, multi-turn, angle-cache, and velocity state.

            Disable this option only when one task owns each instance and no
            concurrent task or ISR can access it. Disabling compiles out all
            mutex operations and reduces the overhead of a high-rate control
            path. Sensor-reading APIs remain unsuitable for ISR use because the
            ESP-IDF I2C master transaction is blocking.

endmenu
